<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Hybrid TV service mappings. All DVB identity fields are hexadecimal.
  namespace + onid + tsid + sid must match exactly; names are documentation only.
  No changes to lamedb or bouquets are needed. Normal DVB services are untouched.

  stream: Play the HTTP(S) media URL directly with the native GStreamer player.
  hbbtv:  Tune the service and open its AUTOSTART AIT application using Red Button.
           Requires an installed HbbTV engine; never treats a web page as video.
  disabled: Keep normal DVB/Red Button behaviour for this service.

  Local entries in /etc/enigma2/hybridservices.xml override these defaults.
  Use the same root/version and only list your changes. Changes are read on zap;
  removing the local entry restores the packaged mapping. Invalid edits retain
  the last valid data until corrected. Stream addresses need maintenance when
  broadcasters change their URLs. No online address search is performed.

  This mapping currently controls live TV, not recording timers or PiP.
-->
